<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{{gravity.title}} - 트리플에스 커뮤니티</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Sora:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com?plugins=forms,container-queries"></script>
    <script src="/js/tailwind.config.js"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/../static/css/style.css">
    <style>
        .gravity-detail-card { background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(26,27,32,.98), rgba(18,19,23,.98)); }
        .gravity-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
        @media (max-width: 768px) { .gravity-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
        @media (max-width: 420px) { .gravity-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); } }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#0d0e12] text-[#e3e2e8] min-h-screen flex flex-col">
{{>layout/header}}

<main class="flex-1 bg-[#0d0e12] text-white pt-6 pb-20 font-sans selection:bg-[#00f5d4] selection:text-black">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <a href="/cosmo/gravity" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-[#00f5d4] transition">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">arrow_back</span>
                그래비티 목록으로
            </a>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-mono text-gray-500">
                <span>COSMO</span><span>/</span><span>GRAVITY</span><span>/</span><span>{{gravity.id}}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        {{#isLiveGravity}}
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#00f5d4]/25 bg-[#00f5d4]/5 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-[#a4fff2]">
            COSMO API에서 조회한 그래비티 상세 정보입니다. 공개되지 않은 투표 수치는 임의로 표시하지 않습니다.
        </div>
        {{/isLiveGravity}}
        {{#archiveNotice}}
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-amber-400/25 bg-amber-400/5 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-amber-100">{{archiveNotice}}</div>
        {{/archiveNotice}}
        {{#apiError}}
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-rose-400/25 bg-rose-400/5 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-rose-100">
            실시간 정보를 불러오지 못해 저장된 아카이브를 표시합니다. {{apiError}}
        </div>
        {{/apiError}}

        <section class="gravity-detail-card relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/10 p-5 sm:p-8 shadow-2xl">
            <div class="absolute -right-16 -top-20 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-[#00f5d4]/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
            <div class="absolute -left-16 -bottom-24 w-64 h-64 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
            <div class="relative flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:justify-between gap-6">
                <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[10px] font-bold tracking-widest bg-[#00f5d4]/10 text-[#00f5d4] border border-[#00f5d4]/30">{{gravity.category}}</span>
                        <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md text-[10px] font-bold bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/20">{{gravity.status}}</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p class="text-xs font-mono tracking-[.25em] text-gray-500 mb-2">GRAVITY ARCHIVE · #{{gravity.id}}</p>
                        <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight">{{gravity.title}}</h1>
                        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-300 leading-7 mt-4">{{gravity.description}}</p>
                        {{#gravity.bannerImageUrl}}
                        <img src="{{gravity.bannerImageUrl}}" alt="{{gravity.title}} 배너" loading="lazy" class="mt-4 w-full max-h-64 object-cover rounded-xl border border-white/10" />
                        {{/gravity.bannerImageUrl}}
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-1">
                        <a href="/cosmo/gravity" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-[#00f5d4] text-black text-sm font-bold hover:bg-[#7dffeb] transition">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">list</span> 전체 그래비티 보기
                        </a>
                        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-sm text-gray-300">
                            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">history</span> 아카이브 기록
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full lg:max-w-xs rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-black/25 p-5">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                        <span class="text-xs text-gray-400">총 스테이킹 COMO</span>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#00f5d4]">token</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-mono text-[#00f5d4]">{{gravity.como}}</p>
                    <div class="mt-5 pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-start gap-3">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-gray-500">calendar_month</span>
                        <div>
                            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-1">투표 진행 기간</p>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-200 font-mono">{{gravity.period}}</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        {{#gravity.hasWinner}}
        <section class="rounded-2xl border border-[#00f5d4]/25 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#00f5d4]/10 to-purple-500/10 p-5 sm:p-6">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-4">
                {{#gravity.winnerImageUrl}}
                <img src="{{gravity.winnerImageUrl}}" alt="{{gravity.winnerTitle}}" loading="lazy"
                     class="w-20 h-20 rounded-xl object-cover border border-white/10" />
                {{/gravity.winnerImageUrl}}
                <div class="min-w-0">
                    <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-[#00f5d4]">FINAL RESULT · COSMO</p>
                    <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-extrabold mt-1">최종 선정: {{gravity.winnerTitle}}</h2>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-1">COSMO API가 공개한 그래비티 결과 정보입니다.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        {{/gravity.hasWinner}}

        {{#isKnownGravity}}
        <section class="gravity-grid">
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#16181f] p-4 sm:p-5">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[#00f5d4]">fingerprint</span>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-3">Gravity ID</p>
                <p class="text-xl font-bold font-mono mt-1">#{{gravity.id}}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#16181f] p-4 sm:p-5">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-purple-400">how_to_vote</span>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-3">진행 상태</p>
                <p class="text-lg font-bold mt-1">{{gravity.status}}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#16181f] p-4 sm:p-5">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-amber-300">groups</span>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-3">기록된 항목 수</p>
                <p class="text-xl font-bold font-mono mt-1">{{gravity.candidateCount}}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#16181f] p-4 sm:p-5">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-pink-400">database</span>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-3">결과 데이터</p>
                {{#isLiveGravity}}<p class="text-lg font-bold mt-1">COSMO API 결과</p>{{/isLiveGravity}}
                {{^isLiveGravity}}<p class="text-lg font-bold mt-1">아카이브 요약</p>{{/isLiveGravity}}
            </div>
        </section>
        {{/isKnownGravity}}

        <!-- Apollo 공개 집계: Poll ID를 연결해 실시간 집계를 조회하며, 후보별 결과는 최종 공개 후에만 표시합니다. -->
        <section id="apollo-detail-panel" class="rounded-2xl border border-[#00f5d4]/25 bg-[#11151a] p-5 sm:p-6 space-y-5">
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-3">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
                        <span class="w-2 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#00f5d4]"></span>
                        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Apollo 실시간 투표 집계</h2>
                        <span class="rounded-full border border-[#00f5d4]/30 bg-[#00f5d4]/10 px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-[#00f5d4]">토큰 불필요</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-5 text-gray-400">
                        전체 투표 수와 COMO 사용량은 실시간으로 표시합니다. 후보별 득표와 순위는 Apollo가 최종 결과를 공개한 경우에만 표시합니다.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <a href="https://apollo.cafe/gravity/idntt/233" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
                   class="text-xs text-[#00f5d4] hover:underline shrink-0">Apollo 원본 페이지 ↗</a>
            </div>

            {{#apolloPollError}}
            <p class="rounded-lg border border-rose-400/25 bg-rose-400/5 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-rose-100">{{apolloPollError}}</p>
            {{/apolloPollError}}

            <form action="/cosmo/gravity/{{gravity.id}}" method="get" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2">
                <label for="apollo-detail-poll-id" class="sr-only">COSMO Poll ID</label>
                <input id="apollo-detail-poll-id" name="pollId" type="number" min="1" step="1" required
                       value="{{apolloPollId}}" placeholder="COSMO Poll ID (Gravity ID와 다를 수 있음)"
                       class="min-w-0 flex-1 rounded-xl border border-white/15 bg-black/30 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-white placeholder:text-gray-500 focus:border-[#00f5d4] focus:outline-none">
                <button type="submit" class="rounded-xl bg-[#00f5d4] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-black hover:brightness-110">Poll ID 연결 / 조회</button>
            </form>

            <p id="apollo-detail-status" role="status" class="text-sm text-gray-400">
                {{#hasApolloPollId}}Poll #{{apolloPollId}} 집계를 불러오는 중입니다. 30초마다 자동 갱신됩니다.{{/hasApolloPollId}}
                {{^hasApolloPollId}}이 Gravity의 COSMO Poll ID를 입력하면 공개 집계를 연결합니다.{{/hasApolloPollId}}
            </p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/20 p-4">
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">전체 투표 기록</p>
                    <p id="apollo-detail-total-votes" class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold font-mono text-white">—</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/20 p-4">
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">사용된 COMO</p>
                    <p id="apollo-detail-total-como" class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold font-mono text-[#00f5d4]">—</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/20 p-4">
                    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">공개된 투표 기록</p>
                    <p id="apollo-detail-revealed-votes" class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold font-mono text-purple-300">—</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/20 p-4">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-white">후보별 최종 결과</h3>
                    <p id="apollo-detail-candidate-note" class="mt-1 text-xs leading-5 text-gray-500">최종 결과가 공개되기 전에는 후보별 득표를 표시하지 않습니다.</p>
                    <div id="apollo-detail-candidates" class="mt-3 space-y-2">
                        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">최종 결과 공개 대기 중</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/20 p-4">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-white">시간대별 집계</h3>
                    <div id="apollo-detail-chart" class="mt-3 space-y-2">
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">조회 후 시간대별 투표 수와 COMO가 표시됩니다.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/20 p-4">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-white">상위 투표 기록</h3>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-gray-500">후보 선택 정보는 최종 결과 공개 전까지 숨깁니다.</p>
                    <div id="apollo-detail-top-votes" class="mt-3 space-y-2">
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">조회 후 기록이 표시됩니다.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/20 p-4">
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-white">상위 참여자</h3>
                    <div id="apollo-detail-top-users" class="mt-3 space-y-2">
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">조회 후 참여자 집계가 표시됩니다.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <script>
        (() => {
            const input = document.getElementById('apollo-detail-poll-id');
            const status = document.getElementById('apollo-detail-status');
            if (!input || !status) return;

            const numberFormat = new Intl.NumberFormat('ko-KR');
            const setText = (id, value) => {
                const node = document.getElementById(id);
                if (node) node.textContent = value;
            };
            const makeElement = (tag, className, text) => {
                const node = document.createElement(tag);
                if (className) node.className = className;
                node.textContent = text;
                return node;
            };
            const replaceItems = (id, items) => {
                const node = document.getElementById(id);
                if (node) node.replaceChildren(...items);
            };

            async function refreshAggregate() {
                const pollId = input.value.trim();
                if (!/^\\d+$/.test(pollId) || Number(pollId) <= 0) {
                    status.textContent = 'Poll ID를 입력하면 Apollo 공개 집계를 조회할 수 있습니다.';
                    return;
                }

                status.textContent = 'Apollo 공개 집계를 조회하고 있습니다…';
                try {
                    const response = await fetch('/api/cosmo/gravity/aggregate?pollId=' + encodeURIComponent(pollId), {
                        headers: { 'Accept': 'application/json' },
                        cache: 'no-store'
                    });
                    const data = await response.json();
                    if (!response.ok || data.error) throw new Error(data.error || ('HTTP ' + response.status));

                    const totalVotes = Number(data.totalVoteCount ?? 0);
                    const revealedVotes = Number(data.revealedVoteCount ?? 0);
                    const isFinalized = Boolean(
                        data.finalized &&
                        Array.isArray(data.finalized.comoPerCandidate) &&
                        totalVotes > 0 &&
                        revealedVotes === totalVotes
                    );

                    setText('apollo-detail-total-votes', numberFormat.format(totalVotes));
                    setText('apollo-detail-total-como', numberFormat.format(data.totalComoCount ?? 0) + ' COMO');
                    setText('apollo-detail-revealed-votes', numberFormat.format(revealedVotes) + ' / ' + numberFormat.format(totalVotes));

                    const candidates = [];
                    if (isFinalized) {
                        data.finalized.comoPerCandidate
                            .map((amount, index) => ({ index, amount: Number(amount) || 0 }))
                            .sort((a, b) => b.amount - a.amount)
                            .forEach((candidate, rank) => {
                                candidates.push(makeElement('div', 'flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-lg border border-white/10 px-3 py-2 text-sm',
                                    '#' + (rank + 1) + ' · 후보 ' + (candidate.index + 1) + ' · ' + numberFormat.format(candidate.amount) + ' COMO'));
                            });
                        setText('apollo-detail-candidate-note', 'Apollo가 최종 공개한 후보별 COMO 합계입니다. 후보명은 별도 후보 메타데이터가 있을 때만 표시합니다.');
                    } else {
                        candidates.push(makeElement('p', 'text-sm text-gray-500', '후보별 최종 득표는 아직 공개되지 않았습니다.'));
                        setText('apollo-detail-candidate-note', '모든 투표의 공개가 완료되고 Apollo가 최종 집계를 제공하면 후보별 결과를 표시합니다.');
                    }
                    replaceItems('apollo-detail-candidates', candidates);

                    const chart = (Array.isArray(data.chartData) ? data.chartData.slice(-8) : []).map(item => {
                        const date = item.timestamp
                            ? new Date(item.timestamp).toLocaleString('ko-KR', { month: 'numeric', day: 'numeric', hour: '2-digit', minute: '2-digit' })
                            : '시간 미상';
                        return makeElement('div', 'flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-white/5 pb-2 text-xs',
                            date + ' · ' + numberFormat.format(item.voteCount ?? 0) + '표 · ' + numberFormat.format(item.totalTokenAmount ?? 0) + ' COMO');
                    });
                    if (!chart.length) chart.push(makeElement('p', 'text-xs text-gray-500', '시간대별 기록이 없습니다.'));
                    replaceItems('apollo-detail-chart', chart);

                    const topVotes = (Array.isArray(data.topVotes) ? data.topVotes.slice(0, 10) : []).map(vote => {
                        const candidate = isFinalized && vote.candidateId !== null && vote.candidateId !== undefined
                            ? '후보 ' + (Number(vote.candidateId) + 1)
                            : '후보 비공개';
                        const voter = vote.username || (vote.voter ? String(vote.voter).slice(0, 8) + '…' + String(vote.voter).slice(-4) : '주소 미공개');
                        return makeElement('div', 'flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-white/5 pb-2 text-xs',
                            voter + ' · ' + candidate + ' · ' + numberFormat.format(vote.comoAmount ?? 0) + ' COMO');
                    });
                    if (!topVotes.length) topVotes.push(makeElement('p', 'text-xs text-gray-500', '공개된 상위 투표 기록이 없습니다.'));
                    replaceItems('apollo-detail-top-votes', topVotes);

                    const topUsers = (Array.isArray(data.topUsers) ? data.topUsers.slice(0, 10) : []).map(user => {
                        const nickname = user.nickname || (user.address ? String(user.address).slice(0, 8) + '…' + String(user.address).slice(-4) : '사용자 미공개');
                        return makeElement('div', 'flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-white/5 pb-2 text-xs',
                            nickname + ' · ' + numberFormat.format(user.total ?? 0) + ' COMO');
                    });
                    if (!topUsers.length) topUsers.push(makeElement('p', 'text-xs text-gray-500', '공개된 참여자 집계가 없습니다.'));
                    replaceItems('apollo-detail-top-users', topUsers);

                    status.textContent = 'Poll #' + pollId + ' · 마지막 조회 ' + new Date().toLocaleTimeString('ko-KR') +
                        ' · ' + (isFinalized ? '최종 결과 공개' : '후보별 결과 비공개') + ' · 30초마다 자동 갱신';
                } catch (error) {
                    status.textContent = 'Apollo 집계를 가져오지 못했습니다: ' + (error?.message || '알 수 없는 오류') +
                        ' · Poll ID와 Apollo 공개 API 접근 가능 여부를 확인하세요.';
                }
            }

            if (input.value.trim()) {
                refreshAggregate();
                window.setInterval(refreshAggregate, 30000);
            }
        })();
        </script>

        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <div class="lg:col-span-2 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#16181f] p-5 sm:p-6">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-5">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1"><span class="w-1.5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#00f5d4]"></span><h2 class="text-lg font-bold">후보 및 선택 항목</h2></div>
                        {{#isLiveGravity}}<p class="text-xs text-gray-500">COSMO API에서 확인한 후보 및 공개된 결과입니다.</p>{{/isLiveGravity}}
                        {{^isLiveGravity}}<p class="text-xs text-gray-500">목록 페이지에 기록된 아카이브 항목입니다.</p>{{/isLiveGravity}}
                    </div>
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-gray-500">ballot</span>
                </div>
                {{#gravity.hasCandidates}}
                <div class="space-y-3">
                    {{#gravity.candidates}}
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/20 p-4 hover:border-[#00f5d4]/30 transition">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 font-mono text-sm text-[#00f5d4]">{{number}}</div>
                        {{#imageUrl}}<img src="{{imageUrl}}" alt="{{name}}" loading="lazy" class="w-14 h-14 rounded-lg object-cover border border-white/10" />{{/imageUrl}}
                        <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                            <p class="font-bold text-white break-words">{{name}}</p>
                            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">{{type}}</p>
                            {{#amount}}<p class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#00f5d4] mt-1">{{amount}}</p>{{/amount}}
                        </div>
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-gray-600">chevron_right</span>
                    </div>
                    {{/gravity.candidates}}
                </div>
                {{/gravity.hasCandidates}}
                {{^gravity.hasCandidates}}
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-dashed border-white/15 p-8 text-center">
                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl text-gray-600">hourglass_empty</span>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mt-3">등록된 후보 정보가 없습니다.</p>
                </div>
                {{/gravity.hasCandidates}}
            </div>

            <aside class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#16181f] p-5 sm:p-6 h-fit">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4"><span class="w-1.5 h-5 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></span><h2 class="text-lg font-bold">결과 데이터 안내</h2></div>
                <div class="rounded-xl border border-amber-400/20 bg-amber-400/5 p-4">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-amber-300 text-sm font-bold"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">info</span> 집계 결과 안내</div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 leading-6 mt-3">{{gravity.resultNote}}</p>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-5 space-y-3 text-xs text-gray-500 leading-5">
                    <p class="flex gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-gray-600">verified_user</span><span>전체 투표 수와 시간대별 집계는 Apollo 공개 API를 통해 30초마다 갱신합니다. 후보별 득표는 최종 결과가 공개된 경우에만 표시합니다.</span></p>
                    <p class="flex gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base text-gray-600">update</span><span>이 화면의 제목과 요약 수치는 현재 그래비티 목록 템플릿에 있는 아카이브 내용을 사용합니다.</span></p>
                </div>
            </aside>
        </section>

        {{#gravity.hasLeaderboard}}
        <section class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#16181f] p-5 sm:p-6">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-5 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></span>
                <h2 class="text-lg font-bold">COMO 참여 순위</h2>
                <span class="text-xs text-gray-500">COSMO 공개 데이터</span>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-2">
                {{#gravity.leaderboard}}
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-black/20 px-4 py-3">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 min-w-0">
                        <span class="font-mono text-[#00f5d4]">#{{rank}}</span>
                        <span class="text-sm font-semibold truncate">{{nickname}}</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-sm font-mono text-gray-300">{{como}}</span>
                </div>
                {{/gravity.leaderboard}}
            </div>
        </section>
        {{/gravity.hasLeaderboard}}

        <div class="flex justify-center pt-2">
            <a href="/cosmo/gravity" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-gray-200 font-semibold transition">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined">arrow_back</span> 그래비티 목록으로 돌아가기
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>
{{>layout/footer}}
</body>
</html>
